    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Blocks Animation allows you to add CSS Animations to all of your Gutenberg blocks in the most elegant way.</p>\n<p>The UI for Blocks Animation feels so native and intuitive, you won&#8217;t even notice it&#8217;s installed. Just install, and you will see animation settings in all the blocks, right in the Block Settings Sidebar.</p>\n<p>All the code and sources for this plugin are publicly available as part of https://github.com/Codeinwp/otter-blocks.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>You can check the changelog <a href=\"https://github.com/Codeinwp/otter-blocks/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">here.</a></p>\n"
    },
